From: Dmitry Minkovsky <dminkovsky@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 01:42:56 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 01/23] Merge Android's album and playlist deletion holders
 into one

The album page and the playlist page each kept a copy of the same holder:
the confirmation flag, the last error and the delete. PageDeletion takes the
log label, the delete call and the dialog, and both pages use it.

