From b17c70d894547a6cc784d9b58b2ac8eb9e402ad8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Minkovsky <dminkovsky@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 02:06:26 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 05/23] Send the masked restore code's groups from core

Each app split the restore code into groups and chose which stay visible,
and the two copies had already drifted apart for short codes. Core now masks
the code and sends the masked groups beside it in BridgeRestoreCodeShare, and
both apps draw them.

