From e02a3f9dafb5d840d53b373d980ae2aec48420f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Minkovsky <dminkovsky@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 02:22:26 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 20/23] Draw Android's now-playing widget from the open
 library's player, with no file

The widget drew the last track from a file the open library wrote on each
now-playing value. Each now-playing value now updates the widget, which
draws what the open library's player plays; with no library open nothing
plays, so the widget shows no track and offers nothing to resume. The file
store and its snapshot go.

