Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 09:15:41 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 23/23] Read Role and Invite lasts as their buttons alone, and
 Pins at once as a heading

The invite boards draw Role and Invite lasts over the buttons without
reading them, and the pinning board draws Pins at once as a primary text
heading that is read. The segmented buttons showed their label to TalkBack
for every caller, so the invite shots read two texts their boards lack, and
the pinning shot drew its heading in the secondary colour. The label is
hidden again, and the pinning screen draws its own heading.

